{"id":"2c69f6ba0ceba942","group":"17","path":"17/17-thm-universal-theory-preservation.md","title":"Universal Axiomatization by Substructure Closure","display":"thm-universal-theory-preservation — Universal Axiomatization by Substructure Closure","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Model Theory (Chang & Keisler, 3rd ed. 1990)","book_abbrev":"17","label":"17-thm-universal-theory-preservation","aliases":["17-thm-universal-theory-preservation"],"display":"thm-universal-theory-preservation — Universal Axiomatization by Substructure Closure","depends_on":["[[17-df-theory-preservation]]","[[17-df-universal-theory]]","[[17-df-model]]","[[17-thm-compactness]]"],"label_origin":"local-descriptive-label","source_section":"3.2","source_result":"Theorem 3.2.2","source_pages_print":[149],"source_pages_djvu":[165],"source_verification":"statement and original proof compared in supplied DjVu OCR; inconsistent-theory case checked locally","verification_date":"2026-10-13"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Model Theory (Chang &amp; Keisler, 3rd ed. 1990)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"17"},{"key":"label","html":"17-thm-universal-theory-preservation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>17-thm-universal-theory-preservation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-universal-theory-preservation — Universal Axiomatization by Substructure Closure"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"105ca7a585f377f9\" href=\"?note=105ca7a585f377f9\" title=\"17-df-theory-preservation\">17-df-theory-preservation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"262cf6e0c0418727\" href=\"?note=262cf6e0c0418727\" title=\"17-df-universal-theory\">17-df-universal-theory</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"53255a372e5c1ee8\" href=\"?note=53255a372e5c1ee8\" title=\"17-df-model\">17-df-model</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"de1a11e45b1a5282\" href=\"?note=de1a11e45b1a5282\" title=\"17-thm-compactness\">17-thm-compactness</a></span></div>"},{"key":"label_origin","html":"local-descriptive-label"},{"key":"source_section","html":"3.2"},{"key":"source_result","html":"Theorem 3.2.2"},{"key":"source_pages_print","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>149</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pages_djvu","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>165</span></div>"},{"key":"source_verification","html":"statement and original proof compared in supplied DjVu OCR; inconsistent-theory case checked locally"},{"key":"verification_date","html":"2026-10-13"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> 固定，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L\">\\(T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SubstructurePreservedTheory}_L\">\\(\\operatorname{SubstructurePreservedTheory}_L\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"105ca7a585f377f9\" href=\"?note=105ca7a585f377f9\" title=\"17-df-theory-preservation\">17-df-theory-preservation</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{UniversalSent}_L\">\\(\\operatorname{UniversalSent}_L\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"262cf6e0c0418727\" href=\"?note=262cf6e0c0418727\" title=\"17-df-universal-theory\">17-df-universal-theory</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Mod}\">\\(\\mathrm{Mod}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"53255a372e5c1ee8\" href=\"?note=53255a372e5c1ee8\" title=\"17-df-model\">17-df-model</a>。所有模型类在同一语言 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> 的 ZFC 元语言中比较。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SubstructurePreservedTheory}_L(T)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists U\\subseteq\\operatorname{UniversalSent}_L\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Mod}(T)=\\mathrm{Mod}(U)\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{SubstructurePreservedTheory}_L(T)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists U\\subseteq\\operatorname{UniversalSent}_L\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Mod}(T)=\\mathrm{Mod}(U)\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对应原书 Theorem 3.2.2；已比对 DjVu 165 的陈述和图示/紧致性证明。全称公理向子结构保持由无量词公式的绝对性推出。反向把全称后承作候选公理；若结构满足这些后承，其图示与原理论有限相容，可嵌入某个原理论模型，因子结构保持而满足原理论。不一致理论也成立：用全称矛盾句公理化空模型类。结论是存在等价的全称公理集，不能误读为原有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 的每一条公理在语法上已经全称。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"17-df-theory-preservation","status":"resolved","id":"105ca7a585f377f9","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-theory-preservation]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-universal-theory","status":"resolved","id":"262cf6e0c0418727","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-universal-theory]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-model","status":"resolved","id":"53255a372e5c1ee8","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-model]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-thm-compactness","status":"resolved","id":"de1a11e45b1a5282","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-thm-compactness]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-theory-preservation","status":"resolved","id":"105ca7a585f377f9","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$L$ 固定，$T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L$。$\\operatorname{SubstructurePreservedTheory}_L$ 见 [[17-df-theory-preserv